        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vanishing Train | ワンマン列車 is a psychological horror game where you work as a train driver on a rural Japanese railway line.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As usual, the protagonist begins their day driving a local train deep in the mountains.<br>However, as they carry out their duties, strange and inexplicable events slowly begin to unfold…</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game set in Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as a train driver and complete your daily duties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person 3D horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four different endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981060/extras/2b98be5e9bdd2266e9ae8ace4fd8d6cf.poster.avif?t=1784027921\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981060/extras/2b98be5e9bdd2266e9ae8ace4fd8d6cf.webm?t=1784027921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981060/extras/2b98be5e9bdd2266e9ae8ace4fd8d6cf.mp4?t=1784027921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can unlock all endings in about 30 to 45 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer’s Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed solo by a 16-year-old.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video &amp; Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individuals and corporations are free to record, upload, and stream videos of this game without prior per